WEBVTT

00:01:27.692 --> 00:01:31.458
per visitar-te.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:35.326
"Sóc el gos que vas enviar a dormir,

00:01:35.326 --> 00:01:38.778
com t'agrada anomenar l'agulla de l'oblit,

00:01:38.778 --> 00:01:41.680
vinc a dir-te una cosa molt simple:

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.304
mai em vas agradar."

00:01:43.304 --> 00:01:45.914
(Rialles)

00:01:45.914 --> 00:01:47.808
"Quan et llepava la cara,

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:50.701
pensava en mossegar-te el nas.

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.680
Quan et mirava assecant-te amb la tovallola,

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.788
volia saltar i capar-te d'una revolada.

00:01:57.788 --> 00:01:59.970
Resentia com et movies,

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.856
la falta de gràcia animal,